Source: Owasp Cheatsheets > HTTP Security Response Headers Cheat Sheet > Adding HTTP Headers in Different Technologies > Express

### Express

You can use [helmet](https://www.npmjs.com/package/helmet) to setup HTTP headers in Express. The code below is a sample for adding the `X-Frame-Options` header.

```javascript
const helmet = require('helmet');
const app = express();
// Sets "X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN"
app.use(
 helmet.frameguard({
 action: "sameorigin",
 })
);
```

