Source: Eslint Rules > no-unreachable-loop > Known Limitations

## Known Limitations

Static code path analysis, in general, does not evaluate conditions. Due to this fact, this rule might miss reporting cases such as the following:

```
for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
 doSomething(i);
 if (true) {
 break;
 }
}
```

